  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Unknown vs Present on 25 May, 2015 In The High Court Of Kerala At Ernakulam Present: The Honourable Mr. Justice B.Kemal Pasha Thursday, The 1St Day Of February 2018 / 12Th Magha, 1939 Crl.MC.No. 1038 of 2016 --------------- St 4620/2015 Of Judicial First Class Magistrate Court-I, Cherthala ------------------- Petitioners/Accused 2 And 3 ------------------------------ 1 M.A.Haris Rahman, Senior Manager, Tata Global Beverages Limited, Pallivasal Packeting Centre, Munnar P.O., Idukki - 686 612. 2 M/S. Tata Global Beverages Limited, Pallivasal Packeting Centre, Munnar P.O., Idukki - 686 612. By Advs.Sri.P.Vijaya Bhanu, Senior Advocate Sri.M.Revikrishnan Smt.Mitha Sudhindran Respondents/Complainant And State: ------------------------------------ 1. Madhusoodhanan B., Food Safety Officer, Cherthala Circle.",
    "facts": "This is a case relating to the limit of iron filling as per order dated 02.11.2017 of the Director (RCD). All States and Union Territories are directed not to launch prosecutions for non-conformance of limit of iron fillings in cases where samples were picked up/tested prior to 19.05.2016. In this case, prosecution has been launched for non- conformance of iron fillings in the year 2014.",
